-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      Run by script through the real loader on a NextZXOS 26.11 card
              copy; 1.0 not yet played by the owner; published at his request

  Replay      9 recordings, 21270 frames, 43206 hook runs, each against the
              original to the same point: every register with R, all 48K RAM
              bar the dead stack, MMU, clock; 2931 published pictures,
              76206000 pixels against an independent plane model driven by the
              game's own instructions. Failures: none. 10 broken builds caught
              of 10; ABI cases 1152.

  Emulator    JNext 1.1.104 headless: through the real .NEXCLASH loader on a
              private NextZXOS 26.11 card copy, default, Enhanced, all cheats
              in each, output byte for byte as nxc.py makes it, reaching play;
              soak 15 emulated minutes; flicker

  Coverage    Scripted input, no human play: title, options, deaths, game
              over; all 19 levels by a test poke of the level number; not
              reached: natural play past level 1, natural game completion

  Hardware    none

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
